/* 확인창 공용 부품 (UIConfirmDialog.cs). 부모 전체를 덮는 막, 가운데 창. 여백 규칙의 가운데 모달 */
.wm-confirm {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: rgba(4, 5, 16, 0.6);
}

.wm-confirm__box {
    width: 520px;
    padding: var(--wm-space-panel-pad);
    background-color: rgb(16, 18, 48);
    border-width: 1px;
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
}

.wm-confirm__title {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    font-size: 20px;
    color: rgb(255, 255, 255);
    -unity-font-style: bold;
    white-space: normal;
}

.wm-confirm__text {
    margin: 10px 0 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: rgb(196, 201, 236);
    white-space: normal;
}

.wm-confirm__row {
    flex-direction: row;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    margin-top: 28px;
}

.wm-confirm__button {
    min-width: 120px;
    height: 42px;
    margin: 0 0 0 10px;
    padding: 0 14px;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: rgb(242, 243, 251);
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);
    border-width: 2px;
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    border-radius: 0;
}

.wm-confirm__button:hover {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
}

.wm-confirm__button--main {
    color: rgb(21, 23, 46);
    background-color: rgb(244, 244, 248);
    -unity-font-style: bold;
}

.wm-confirm__button--main:hover {
    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);
}

/* 초점은 파랑. 흰 주 버튼 위에서도 보이게 */
.wm-confirm__button:focus {
    border-color: rgb(110, 180, 255);
}
